d to attend a candidate forum, and a consultant said frontrunners gain little from debating.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://wafb.com/2026/10/19/breaking-down-dollars-us-senate-race/"},{"title":"Davis touts grassroots money","date":"2026-10-19","what":"Davis has raised about 4 million dollars mostly from individuals, refuses corporate PAC money and cites an internal poll showing him 4 points back.","helps":"D","kind":"local","src":"https://wafb.com/2026/10/19/breaking-down-dollars-us-senate-race/"},{"title":"National Democrats stay out","date":"2026-10-19","what":"The national Democratic Party has spent nothing to help Davis, a sign consultants say it does not see Louisiana as winnable.","helps":"R","kind":"national","src":"https://wafb.com/2026/10/19/breaking-down-dollars-us-senate-race/"},{"title":"Letlow frames race against socialists","date":"2026-09-09","what":"Letlow's campaign says she will contrast her record with a Democratic Party it calls overrun by socialists, while Cassidy and Fleming have not endorsed her.","helps":"mixed","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.theadvocate.com/baton_rouge/news/politics/louisiana-senate-julia-letlow-jamie-davis/article_0cde8e22-ed6d-5098-9068-d68826494a6d.html"},{"title":"PPP poll shows a single digit race","date":"2026-09-08","what":"A Public Policy Polling survey had Letlow at 41 percent and Davis at 37 with 22 percent undecided.","helps":"D","kind":"local","src":"https://veritenews.org/2026/09/08/jamie-davis-julia-letlow-senate/"},{"title":"Letlow and Davis win runoffs","date":"2026-06-27","what":"Trump endorsed Letlow beat Treasurer John Fleming after Sen. Bill Cassidy was eliminated in May, and Davis beat Gary Crockett.","helps":"R","kind":"endorsement","src":"https://www.wafb.com/2026/06/28/julia-letlow-jamie-davis-advance-louisiana-us-senate-race-ap-projects/"}],"events":[{"title":"Tariffs and the farm economy","prompt":"Farmers are struggling with weak crop demand and high diesel prices, and tariffs 